# Drive the desktop's absolute pointer to a position the capture that
# follows can be checked against.
#
# The axis range is QEMU's own 0..=32767 rather than guest pixels: the
# host cannot know what mode the guest chose. 16384 on both axes is the
# middle of whatever the guest is presenting.
abs 16384 16384
btn left down
btn left up

# One keystroke, so the capture is taken of a desktop that has had both
# kinds of input rather than only pointer motion.
key spc
